WEBVTT

00:04.012 --> 00:05.411
Even if I'm not...

00:05.480 --> 00:10.383
...much help to my friends
when we're fighting...

00:11.352 --> 00:13.820
...I will at least make sure
I'm not holding them back.

00:14.923 --> 00:16.220
I will...

00:18.159 --> 00:19.683
I will fight!

00:28.203 --> 00:29.101
I did it!

01:09.944 --> 01:11.002
The sky...

01:12.347 --> 01:13.746
This sky of emptiness.

01:14.482 --> 01:17.007
This sky over which
only darkness spreads.

01:20.488 --> 01:23.685
Rumina, I want to go home.

01:23.992 --> 01:26.984
To the surface where
there are stars in the sky.

01:27.262 --> 01:30.390
I want to see a sky where
the sun and moon rises.

01:31.065 --> 01:35.468
I want to see real flowers
swaying in the gentle breeze.

01:53.454 --> 01:56.582
Wherever you may try to hide
in this smoke...

01:56.658 --> 01:59.855
...I can clearly see
every move you make.

02:19.180 --> 02:21.307
I think it's time to give up.

02:44.405 --> 02:45.565
Miss Rorec...

02:46.274 --> 02:49.004
Jilherts, I have a favor to ask you.

02:49.444 --> 02:51.412
Rather, this is an order.

02:57.518 --> 02:59.713
What am I supposed to
do with this?

03:20.708 --> 03:24.144
The city at night is so cold

03:24.212 --> 03:28.080
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

03:28.149 --> 03:31.482
I wonder if I can keep going

03:31.552 --> 03:33.986
The important thing...

03:34.055 --> 03:36.421
You must tell me

03:36.491 --> 03:38.049
Please

03:38.259 --> 03:43.196
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

03:43.264 --> 03:47.860
Tell me that's not true

03:48.670 --> 03:52.436
I loved you so much that it hurt

03:52.507 --> 03:56.102
Everything was sparkling all around

03:56.177 --> 03:59.476
There was nothing to be afraid of

03:59.547 --> 04:03.278
I believed in that

04:03.351 --> 04:06.878
That moment when
my passions stirred

04:06.954 --> 04:10.515
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

04:10.591 --> 04:13.651
I will never forget that moment

04:13.728 --> 04:17.596
I will never say I want to go back

04:17.665 --> 04:23.433
I just want to see you one more time

04:37.685 --> 04:40.922
Fighting for Her Smile
Fighting for Her Smile.

04:40.922 --> 04:44.085
Fighting for Her Smile

04:50.264 --> 04:53.392
You sure have bad manners.

04:56.037 --> 04:59.165
My friends all call me "Sound"...

04:59.240 --> 05:02.437
...but I do have a proper name, "Utsune."

05:03.411 --> 05:05.345
What it means is that...

05:06.381 --> 05:09.179
I can use sound to confuse
a person's mind...

05:09.250 --> 05:11.775
...so I'm able to control
that person with sound.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.314
N-No way...!

05:14.188 --> 05:15.416
If you fall victim to it...

05:15.490 --> 05:18.618
...you become a puppet of mine
who can only hear my voice.

05:19.127 --> 05:20.116
No way...!

05:20.962 --> 05:22.020
Here goes.

05:46.954 --> 05:49.047
I will never give up!

05:50.925 --> 05:54.156
Before, when you were
being taken away...

05:54.228 --> 05:55.559
...I made a promise.

05:58.599 --> 06:00.965
I swore that we'd meet again...

06:01.035 --> 06:04.027
...and that I'd be able
to protect you!

06:26.661 --> 06:27.491
Hexa!

06:29.430 --> 06:31.728
Please wake up!

06:32.366 --> 06:33.196
Hexa!

06:34.735 --> 06:35.565
These eyes...

06:39.040 --> 06:42.203
I've seen these eyes before.

06:45.146 --> 06:45.908
When?

06:46.414 --> 06:47.210
Where?

06:48.816 --> 06:50.545
A long time ago...

06:53.754 --> 06:55.016
Where am I?

07:01.229 --> 07:03.424
Is that me?

07:18.980 --> 07:19.912
Hexa!

07:20.281 --> 07:21.213
Hexa!

07:28.055 --> 07:29.579
What's the matter?!

07:31.225 --> 07:32.351
D-Don't touch me!

07:40.334 --> 07:41.323
Hexa...

07:58.386 --> 08:02.755
I know this man.

08:15.069 --> 08:16.195
I...

08:17.238 --> 08:18.569
...don't know anything!

08:37.858 --> 08:41.157
I loved your smile.

08:42.763 --> 08:47.791
The one thing that brought light
to this dark underground world...

08:47.868 --> 08:49.563
...was your smile.

08:50.204 --> 08:51.865
Try to remember, Hexa!

08:52.940 --> 08:54.430
How you felt then!

08:55.242 --> 08:56.607
The smile you wore then!

08:57.645 --> 08:58.771
Try to remember!

09:00.247 --> 09:02.044
Hexa!

09:16.897 --> 09:18.296
H-Hexa...

09:35.082 --> 09:36.276
I am...

09:38.152 --> 09:39.483
Hexa...

09:54.902 --> 09:55.960
Sui...

09:58.606 --> 09:59.834
Are you Sui?

10:02.877 --> 10:08.941
You finally remembered.

10:12.520 --> 10:13.646
I...

10:19.727 --> 10:20.887
I'm sorry.

10:21.829 --> 10:24.229
What have I done?

10:24.532 --> 10:25.430
It's okay.

10:26.434 --> 10:28.231
Don't you worry.

10:29.170 --> 10:35.131
I'm just happy that you
finally remember who I am.

10:35.342 --> 10:38.072
That's all I need.

10:44.218 --> 10:45.185
Sui...

11:01.902 --> 11:05.895
I knew that's all there was to it.

11:07.541 --> 11:11.841
After all, why would one with
the power to control anyone...

11:11.912 --> 11:14.745
...remain as one of Pairon's peons.

11:17.284 --> 11:19.514
But I wonder about her?

11:21.622 --> 11:22.554
Jilherts?!

11:25.259 --> 11:27.420
Now, come this way.

11:29.130 --> 11:31.792
Hey! Get a hold of yourself!

11:33.701 --> 11:37.933
Forget it.
She can only hear my voice now.

11:38.639 --> 11:43.269
If you don't believe me, I can
give her a very interesting order.

11:50.851 --> 11:53.479
Now! Go and kill that woman!

11:57.491 --> 11:59.049
Another reversal of fortune!

11:59.126 --> 12:02.562
I'm going to watch a couple
of friends kill each other!

12:03.497 --> 12:05.124
How dare a kid...

12:05.366 --> 12:08.824
...get so cocky and
mess around like this!

12:10.604 --> 12:13.437
Don't take us guards so lightly!

12:15.042 --> 12:16.100
Why, you!

12:19.914 --> 12:21.905
That's enough playing around.

12:23.984 --> 12:26.418
Why didn't my power
work on her?!

12:27.521 --> 12:28.715
Oh, right.

12:29.590 --> 12:33.924
These earplugs you gave me
sure came in handy, Miss Rorec.

12:35.830 --> 12:37.195
Earplugs?

12:37.731 --> 12:40.632
I realized it the first time
I saw this flute.

12:40.935 --> 12:45.463
That without this, there's no way
you can exercise your power.

12:59.987 --> 13:05.391
Well, if I haven't seen him yet
after having come this far...

13:06.126 --> 13:09.061
...it must mean that Rumina
made it to the very top.

13:16.337 --> 13:17.895
My mission?

13:18.939 --> 13:21.203
I'm sure if you were
in my position...

13:21.275 --> 13:22.503
...this is what you would say...

13:23.277 --> 13:25.939
..."Even though I'm just
a peon in the Company...

13:26.013 --> 13:29.710
...I am not so stupid as to tell you
what my mission is."

13:29.984 --> 13:30.643
Right?

13:31.018 --> 13:32.508
You calling me a peon?!

13:32.586 --> 13:33.848
I'll make you cry!

13:37.892 --> 13:40.258
Tell me what Pairon's after.

13:40.394 --> 13:42.521
Oh, I didn't see you there.

13:42.596 --> 13:44.188
Don't pretend you didn't see me!

13:44.265 --> 13:46.699
I'm not pretending.

13:47.368 --> 13:49.632
My legs are long and when
I crossed them...

13:49.703 --> 13:51.466
...I happened to kick you.

13:52.273 --> 13:56.403
By the way, I really like kids.

13:58.212 --> 14:03.275
How could I kick a cute kid
like you in the face on purpose?

14:03.951 --> 14:05.919
Why, of course.

14:06.220 --> 14:09.121
What a cute little child this one is.

14:12.126 --> 14:14.890
No!
Your eyes tell me you're lying!

14:15.329 --> 14:16.353
Well, well.

14:16.430 --> 14:18.295
It seems you understand.

14:18.699 --> 14:21.361
This will make things quicker.

14:25.906 --> 14:29.273
So Ruri had already escaped
from the Company!

14:30.811 --> 14:32.278
I don't have time for this!

14:34.448 --> 14:35.278
Where?!

14:35.349 --> 14:36.714
Where is Ruri?!

14:37.418 --> 14:39.443
At the top of Tower Gate!

14:44.191 --> 14:45.453
I'll leave the rest to you!

14:45.526 --> 14:46.618
Uh, right!

14:46.961 --> 14:48.622
Um, Miss Rorec...

14:50.230 --> 14:55.224
You actually called me
by my name before, didn't you?

14:55.569 --> 14:56.627
What?

14:56.704 --> 14:58.103
I don't recall.

14:59.640 --> 15:01.904
Bang!
No way!

15:08.916 --> 15:10.349
Master Sui!

15:11.318 --> 15:12.376
Ginnosuke...

15:12.753 --> 15:14.948
Are you all right, Master Sui?

15:15.556 --> 15:16.682
Yes, I am.

15:17.391 --> 15:20.918
Hexa, I see you're back
to your usual self.

15:21.095 --> 15:22.027
Uh, yes.

15:22.796 --> 15:27.961
We're going to spend some time
together and heal from our wounds.

15:29.203 --> 15:30.170
I see...

15:30.838 --> 15:31.668
I suppose.

15:32.272 --> 15:34.103
That's a good idea.

15:34.742 --> 15:38.371
Those people you are
going up against...

15:38.445 --> 15:41.903
...have different motives from
your usual Company thugs.

15:41.982 --> 15:46.214
If there comes a time when
you can really use my help...

15:46.286 --> 15:50.985
...feel free to contact me using
this Underground communicator.

15:51.825 --> 15:52.883
Th-This...!

15:52.960 --> 15:56.487
I happened to modify the device
that you call a cell phone.

15:56.964 --> 16:01.458
I thought that it was lost forever,
but to think that it was modified.

16:02.302 --> 16:04.293
I will use the weapon I invented...

16:04.371 --> 16:07.397
...to wipe out that detested Company!

16:08.409 --> 16:09.603
Master Sui...

16:09.676 --> 16:13.840
...didn't you say you don't invent
things that hurt people?

16:14.281 --> 16:14.906
Huh?

16:22.289 --> 16:23.586
Master...

16:26.727 --> 16:27.659
This is...

16:29.663 --> 16:32.689
Something really terrible
is going on up there.

16:35.335 --> 16:36.802
What could it be?

16:42.876 --> 16:45.208
So, have you prepared yourself?

16:46.113 --> 16:47.740
P-Prepared?

16:48.315 --> 16:49.942
Prepared for what?

16:50.684 --> 16:51.776
What do you think?

16:52.486 --> 16:55.478
The only thing that's
waiting for you is death!

16:56.824 --> 17:00.920
Each hit you take is like
a countdown to your death.

17:02.763 --> 17:04.025
Kogarasumaru...

17:06.567 --> 17:09.593
You shall fall prey
to this death match!

17:15.609 --> 17:16.598
Sorry.

17:19.546 --> 17:21.343
I have a very important...

17:22.449 --> 17:23.848
Th-This is...

17:27.888 --> 17:30.584
I have a very important ambition!

17:31.058 --> 17:34.425
I am not about to give up
so easily!

17:41.535 --> 17:44.003
A-Ambition?!

17:44.972 --> 17:46.906
What kind of ambition?!

17:47.708 --> 17:49.175
What do you think?

17:49.877 --> 17:51.936
A man's ambition...

17:52.012 --> 17:55.175
...is to live happily ever after
with a pretty girl!

18:15.702 --> 18:16.669
Rumina...

18:21.575 --> 18:23.736
Don't look so sad.

18:24.378 --> 18:25.345
Shiel...

18:29.850 --> 18:33.980
You promised that I could
have my ribbon back later.

18:34.588 --> 18:35.486
I'm sorry.

18:36.123 --> 18:38.614
But I can't even move one step.

18:38.859 --> 18:39.723
Why not?

18:40.460 --> 18:42.894
It's because I'm alone.

18:44.398 --> 18:46.298
I'm all alone now.

18:49.069 --> 18:50.366
What are you talking about?

18:52.005 --> 18:54.235
You're not alone at all.

18:58.245 --> 19:02.443
You're not alone.
Look around you a little more.

19:10.357 --> 19:13.383
I understand, Shiel...

19:16.363 --> 19:18.388
A flow of air?

19:21.802 --> 19:24.100
Making the steel cables vibrate.

19:24.605 --> 19:26.800
It's not a cold flow of air.

19:28.242 --> 19:30.972
This is something I've felt before.

19:32.379 --> 19:34.574
When I was on the surface...

19:35.115 --> 19:37.208
And there, too...

19:37.417 --> 19:39.146
And there...

19:40.387 --> 19:43.948
A gentle flow that
caresses my hair...

19:47.094 --> 19:48.186
A wind.

19:53.100 --> 19:54.032
Ruri!

20:11.184 --> 20:12.151
Rumina...

20:23.297 --> 20:24.229
Ruri...

20:44.151 --> 20:48.918
Again, I walk the streets today

20:48.989 --> 20:54.928
As if I have a purpose

20:54.995 --> 21:06.839
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.175 --> 21:19.018
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.086 --> 21:30.588
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.398 --> 21:40.238
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.307 --> 21:44.038
I tried to listen

21:44.111 --> 21:52.246
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.319 --> 22:01.318
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.137 --> 22:12.037
Preview

22:13.373 --> 22:15.807
I've finally come
face to face with Ruri.

22:15.876 --> 22:16.774
Oh, no.

22:16.843 --> 22:18.435
What am I supposed to say?

22:18.545 --> 22:20.103
Huh? Me?
My hair's long?

22:20.180 --> 22:22.580
What if I tie it back?

22:22.649 --> 22:24.514
Huh? What?
What the hell am I talking about?!

22:24.785 --> 22:28.585
There are lots of more important
things I wanted to say to her.

22:28.889 --> 22:31.756
But words aren't coming out!

22:32.659 --> 22:34.991
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:35.061 --> 22:36.096
..."Wind Blowing Away the Tears."

22:36.096 --> 22:37.697
Wind Blowing Away the Tears
..."Wind Blowing Away the Tears."

22:37.697 --> 22:39.995
Wind Blowing Away the Tears
